# Design bundles are unpacked into design/<name>/; the archive itself is noise.
design/*.zip

# Local wall photos, for iterating the design against a real image. Served only
# by the dev-only `mantel-dev-photos` plugin in vite.config.ts, so they cannot
# reach a build — deliberately NOT under public/, which Vite copies into dist/
# verbatim. /tv has no auth until v2, so a published family photo would be
# world-readable. Real photos belong in the Supabase Storage `photos` bucket.
dev-photos/
